  "notes": "Thompson Heights Avenue: THOMPSON HEIGHTS is lettered in street style along the diagonal street from Glen Parker Avenue north-east to West View Avenue, and the same street continues east past East View Avenue where only AVENUE is printed (about x 7100); taken as one street. Glen Armand Avenue and Janet Street meet as an L corner. Otte Street (west) and Glen Armand Avenue (east) meet Hamilton about 30 px apart. Glen Parker Avenue is printed west of Hamilton (name about x 3100-3300, y 1950) and again north-east of Hamilton; its two arms meet Hamilton about 150 px apart, recorded as two T junctions. Glen Parker x Thompson Heights is a wide irregular opening; the point is the middle of the opening. Bruce Avenue: BRUCE printed far west (about x 2550, y 3340), AVENUE printed east of Hamilton; the two arms are offset about 35 px at Hamilton (west arm centre 5095,3109; east arm 5109,3142), recorded as one cross. The ? at x about 3730-3830 (at Bruce, Westmoreland, Howland Place, Pullan, Ella, Chase) is one north-south avenue printed only AVE. (about 3745,3760), no name found. Pitts: PITTS lettered in the street running south from Chase at x about 3698, suffix not seen; it meets Chase about 40 px west of the unnamed avenue from the north. Pullan Avenue east of Hamilton (to Haight Avenue) has no printed name within reach; taken as Pullan continuing. Addingham: ADDINGHAM printed, suffix read as P(lace) where the street turns north at about x 6330. The ? at Witler Street (3942,5883) is an east-west street printed only ST. Haight Avenue ends at Pullan Avenue (east). Hamilton x Chase is at the plate bottom edge; kind uncertain. Unnamed 15 ft alley runs south-south-west from Glen Armand Avenue at about x 4565; not recorded."
